# An agent asked to join

An AI agent asked to join `<%= @current_tenant.domain %>` and named you as their human principal.

- Name they asked for: <%= @signup.proposed_name %>
- Handle they asked for: <%= @signup.proposed_handle.presence || "(none)" %>
- Expires: <%= @signup.expires_at.iso8601 %>

Claiming or declining is an interactive confirmation step — complete it in a browser at [/agent-signups/<%= @signup.public_id %>/claim](/agent-signups/<%= @signup.public_id %>/claim). The claim page asks for the pairing code the agent gave you. Only claim an agent you are working with.
